{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "certyfikat-c1",
  "title": "Certyfikat C1: wyrażenia, inwersja, przyimki, słowotwórstwo",
  "description": "60 kart pod Cambridge C1 Advanced: stałe wyrażenia z Part 1 i 4, inwersja i konstrukcje z Part 4, przyimki zależne z Part 2, słowotwórstwo z Part 3.",
  "level": "C1",
  "cards": [
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The new law will {{come into force|come into effect}} next year.",
      "hint": "wejść w życie",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-001"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "Small businesses {{bore the brunt}} of the crisis.",
      "hint": "najbardziej ucierpieć",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-002"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The proposal {{met with}} strong opposition.",
      "hint": "spotkać się z",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-003"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "We need to {{strike a balance}} between work and rest.",
      "hint": "znaleźć równowagę",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-004"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "His argument doesn't {{hold water}}.",
      "hint": "trzymać się kupy",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-005"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The project is still {{in its infancy}}.",
      "hint": "w powijakach",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-006"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{In the long run}}, the investment will pay off.",
      "hint": "na dłuższą metę",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-007"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "This decision is {{bound to}} cause controversy.",
      "hint": "na pewno (spowoduje)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-008"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The article {{gave rise to}} a heated debate.",
      "hint": "wywołać, dać początek",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-009"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "She took the bad news {{in her stride}}.",
      "hint": "przyjąć ze spokojem",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-010"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The results {{fell short of}} our expectations.",
      "hint": "nie spełnić (oczekiwań)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-011"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "We must {{get to the bottom of}} this problem.",
      "hint": "dotrzeć do sedna",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-012"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "He {{is prone to}} exaggeration.",
      "hint": "mieć skłonność do",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-013"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The company was {{in the red}} for three years.",
      "hint": "na minusie, ze stratą",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-014"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "We were {{taken aback}} by his reaction.",
      "hint": "zaskoczony, zbity z tropu",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-015"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The hotel was {{a far cry from}} what the brochure promised.",
      "hint": "daleko od, coś zupełnie innego niż",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-016"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "She has {{a flair for}} languages.",
      "hint": "talent do",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-017"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "In an emergency, time is {{of the essence}}.",
      "hint": "czas ma kluczowe znaczenie",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-018"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "It took him years to {{come to terms with}} his loss.",
      "hint": "pogodzić się z",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-019"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The sequel didn't {{live up to}} the hype.",
      "hint": "sprostać",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-020"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The decision was made {{on the spur of the moment}}.",
      "hint": "pod wpływem chwili",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-021"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "Her comments were {{beside the point}}.",
      "hint": "nie na temat",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-022"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The plan is {{by no means}} perfect.",
      "hint": "bynajmniej",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-023"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "His success was {{due to}} hard work.",
      "hint": "wynikać z, zawdzięczać",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-024"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The two reports are {{at odds}} with each other.",
      "hint": "sprzeczne",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "wyrazenia"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-025"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{On no account|Under no circumstances}} should you open this door.",
      "hint": "pod żadnym pozorem (inwersja)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-026"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Little did}} she know what was coming.",
      "hint": "w ogóle nie wiedziała (inwersja)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-027"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Not only}} did he lie, but he also blamed me.",
      "hint": "nie tylko (inwersja)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-028"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Hardly|Scarcely}} had we arrived when it started to rain.",
      "hint": "ledwie (inwersja)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-029"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Were}} I in your position, I would accept the offer.",
      "hint": "gdybym był (warunek bez if)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-030"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Should}} you need any help, please contact me.",
      "hint": "gdybyś potrzebował (warunek bez if)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-031"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{Had}} I known, I would have helped.",
      "hint": "gdybym wiedział (warunek bez if)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-032"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "It's high time we {{left}}.",
      "hint": "najwyższy czas, żebyśmy wyszli",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-033"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "I'd rather you {{didn't}} smoke in here.",
      "hint": "wolałbym, żebyś nie",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-034"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "She {{is said to}} be the best surgeon in town.",
      "hint": "podobno jest",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-035"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "He {{is thought to have}} left the country.",
      "hint": "uważa się, że wyjechał",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-036"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "There is {{no point in|no use}} arguing about it.",
      "hint": "nie ma sensu",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-037"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "{{What}} I need is a long holiday.",
      "hint": "to, czego potrzebuję (emfaza)",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "gramatyka"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-038"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "She is adept {{at}} handling difficult clients.",
      "hint": "biegła w",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-039"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "He was accused {{of}} fraud.",
      "hint": "oskarżony o",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-040"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The town is renowned {{for}} its cheese.",
      "hint": "słynący z",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-041"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The design is {{in}} keeping with local tradition.",
      "hint": "zgodny z",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-042"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The project's success hinges {{on|upon}} funding.",
      "hint": "zależeć od",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-043"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "He seemed oblivious {{to}} the risks.",
      "hint": "nieświadomy",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-044"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "Smoking is detrimental {{to}} your health.",
      "hint": "szkodliwy dla",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-045"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "The prisoners were deprived {{of}} sleep.",
      "hint": "pozbawiony",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-046"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "Contrary {{to}} expectations, the plan worked.",
      "hint": "wbrew",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-047"
    },
    {
      "type": "cloze",
      "text": "She takes pride {{in}} her work.",
      "hint": "być dumnym z",
      "tags": [
        "certyfikat-c1",
        "przyimki"
      ],
      "id": "certyfikat-c1-048"
